```text
E-11
1.
Increase the number of prescribers using PDMPs;
2.
Improve point-of-care decision-making by increasing the quantity, quality,
or format of data available to prescribers using PDMPs, by improving the
interface that prescribers use to access PDMP data, or both; or
3.
Enable states to use PDMP data in support of surveillance or intervention
